From d304ca91723e1011734d89ee2c5c8f560cfda8d0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 23 May 2021 19:59:44 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Remove checking of miner funding from CreateNewBlock_validity
 test (#187)

This commit stops CreateNewBlock_validity from checking miner funding
in the coinbase, as well as makes finding txIds in the blocks more
generic. The second change makes updating the test less fragile. The
specific ordering is no longer important since the introduction of
CTOR.

Rebase provenance: this historical change was adapted onto the pinned
Bitcoin ABC base. Source diff is the recorded Lotus V1 replay commit below.

Historical-source-commit: 6417d480b2ff1f98083403d20fb744b116e52539
Recorded-replay-commit: 46fd5386e2885cfafb45a050bd4ba4ed335d1ddf

